# SEO page rules

- One primary keyword per URL; update `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md` when adding pages.
- Title ≤60 chars with primary keyword near the start; meta description 50–165 (aim ≤155).
- Exactly one H1; logical H2/H3; answer-first intro 40–60 words on home/tools/guides.
- Self-referencing canonical from `siteConfig.siteUrl`; trailing slash; lowercase hyphenated slugs.
- Include BreadcrumbList + WebApplication (tools) or Article + FAQPage (guides with FAQ).
- No fake ratings; no thin query-variant duplicates.
- Cite sources; set datePublished/dateModified.
- Tool pages: topical “Learn more” guide links; never a fixed unrelated related-tools list.
- Site origin: see `docs/CUSTOM-DOMAIN.md` / `docs/SEO-GUARDRAILS.md` — no hardcoded site host.
